      "displayText": "시작해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC791D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개구마르에게 인류의 위대함을...\n아니, 너의 위대함을 보여 주라고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CAD6CB9C8B974C5D0AC8C0020C778B958C7580020C704B300D568C744002E002E002E000AC544B2C8002C0020B108C7580020C704B300D568C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCB77CACE0002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다시 한번\n너의 위대함을 녀석에게 보여 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C2DC0020D55CBC88000AB108C7580020C704B300D568C7440020B140C11DC5D0AC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C918002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 대단한걸! 비계를 내달리는 너는\n그야말로 비계 코스계의 닌자야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020B300B2E8D55CAC7800210020BE44ACC4B97C0020B0B4B2ECB9ACB2940020B108B294000AADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020BE44ACC40020CF54C2A4ACC4C7580020B2CCC790C57C002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개굴!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CAD7400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비계 코스를 통해 너와 개구마르 사이에\n유대가 생긴 것 같은데!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n개구마르를 동료로 만드는 건 어때?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44ACC40020CF54C2A4B97C0020D1B5D5740020B108C6400020AC1CAD6CB9C8B9740020C0ACC774C5D0000AC720B300AC000020C0DDAE340020AC830020AC19C740B370002100100001BE00000AAC1CAD6CB9C8B974B97C0020B3D9B8CCB85C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC740020C5B4B54C003F00100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개구르.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CAD6CB974002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개구마르를 잡았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CAD6CB9C8B974B97C0020C7A1C558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "덕분에 좋은 구경했어!\n이건 최단 시간 클리어를 경신한 보상이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B355BD84C5D00020C88BC7400020AD6CACBDD588C5B40021000AC774AC740020CD5CB2E80020C2DCAC040020D074B9ACC5B4B97C0020ACBDC2E0D55C0020BCF4C0C1C774C57C002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬인 개구마르와 호각을 다투는\n기동력을 가진 너는 최강이나 다름없어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n개구마르와 함께\n모든 비계 코스를 클리어해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "개구마르를 동료로 만들려면\n박스를 정리해 주십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC1CAD6CB9C8B974B97C0020B3D9B8CCB85C0020B9CCB4E4B824BA74000ABC15C2A4B97C0020C815B9ACD5740020C8FCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿;",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 비계 코스의\n최단 시간 클리어에도 도전해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020BE44ACC40020CF54C2A4C758000ACD5CB2E80020C2DCAC040020D074B9ACC5B4C5D0B3C40020B3C4C804D5740020C918002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿=",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0004>Sp_1를 누르다니,\n기권하려는 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0A000400530070005F0031B97C0020B204B974B2E4B2C8002C000AAE30AD8CD558B824B2940020AC70C57C003F00100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내게 말을 걸다니,\n기권하려는 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78B2E4B2C8002C000AAE30AD8CD558B824B2940020AC70C57C003F00100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기권한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30AD8CD55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기권하지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30AD8CD558C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네버 기브 업!\n비계 코스는 언제나 너를 기다리고 있다고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124BC840020AE30BE0C0020C5C50021000ABE44ACC40020CF54C2A4B2940020C5B8C81CB0980020B108B97C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788B2E4ACE0002E00100002011401890000",
